## 1. 命令

```console
$ python -c "import sys,pyphen,nltk;print(sys.version);print(pyphen.__file__);print(nltk.data.find('corpora/cmudict'))"
3.12.10 (tags/v3.12.10:0cc8128, Apr  8 2025, 12:21:36) [MSC v.1943 64 bit (AMD64)]
D:\Programs\Python\Python312\Lib\site-packages\pyphen\__init__.py
C:\Users\Administrator\AppData\Roaming\nltk_data\corpora\cmudict

$ ls "C:/Users/Administrator/AppData/Roaming/nltk_data/corpora/cmudict/"
README
cmudict

$ python - <<'PY'   # 采集：shutil.copyfile（二进制逐字节拷贝，不做行尾/编码转换）
import os, shutil, pyphen
D = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(pyphen.__file__), 'dictionaries')
dest = 'vendor/upstream/pyphen'
os.makedirs(dest, exist_ok=True)
names = ['hyph_en_US.dic','hyph_en_GB.dic','hyph_de_DE.dic','hyph_es.dic','hyph_fr.dic',
         'hyph_it_IT.dic','hyph_nl_NL.dic','hyph_pl_PL.dic','hyph_ru_RU.dic','hyph_hu_HU.dic']
for n in names:
    shutil.copyfile(os.path.join(D, n), os.path.join(dest, n))

cm = r'C:\Users\Administrator\AppData\Roaming\nltk_data\corpora\cmudict'
cdst = 'vendor/upstream/cmudict'
os.makedirs(cdst, exist_ok=True)
for f in os.listdir(cm):
    if f in ('cmudict','README','LICENSE','LICENSE.txt','cmudict.dict'):
        shutil.copyfile(os.path.join(cm,f), os.path.join(cdst,f))

for lang in ('en','es'):
    src = f'textstat/textstat/resources/{lang}/easy_words.txt'
    dst = f'vendor/upstream/easy_words/{lang}/easy_words.txt'
    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(dst), exist_ok=True)
    shutil.copyfile(src, dst)
PY

$ python tools/verify_l1.py ; echo EXIT=$?
```

> `shutil.copyfile` 只搬运字节，不做换行归一化/重编码；两份易读词表因此保持 CRLF 原字节（`\r` 计数见 §4 的 `CR:` 行仅覆盖非词表固定字节，词表的 CRLF 是身份的一部分）。

